            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Lifewick Candle"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divine, necromancy, negative)\n\n15 feet.\n\nA ghostly blue flame within the chouchin-obake draws upon the life-force of the living to sustain themself. At the start of the chouchin-obake's turn, each creature in the aura takes 2d6 negative damage (26 basic Fortitude save). The chouchinobake regains an amount of Hit Points equal to the amount of damage taken by the single creature that took the most damage."
            },
